# Real-line inverse-Fourier weighted energies

This barrel collects reusable real-line inverse-Fourier energy estimates. It provides
interpolation between ordinary and quadratic physical-space energy, Plancherel and
derivative endpoint identities for compact multipliers, and explicit inverse-Gaussian
multiplier bounds for sinc-six spectral envelopes.
